text I clench my fist.
text My nails bite into my palm.
text Without the pain, I would have been moved.
text My heart would have been moved by this girl... fighting all by herself... before my eyes.
text However...
text Even though I realize it now, it may be too late.
text Still clenching my fist, I look at Kyou.
text Her face is a mirror image of Fujibayashi's.
text Whether I like it or not, I am reminded of Fujibayashi.
text And it is exactly that thought that keeps my legs stopped in that same spot.
